    "blurb": "Extract data from documents and images",
    "overview": "Integrate Google Cloud Document AI into Camunda processes to extract structured data from PDFs and images. The connector handles OCR, entity extraction, and table parsing with secure OAuth 2.0 authentication via Google Cloud service accounts.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Extract structured data from documents and images using Google Cloud",
    "splashDescription": "Document-heavy workflows such as invoice processing, form extraction, and scanned record handling often require custom integration work to connect orchestration platforms with AI-powered document services. The GCP Document AI connector brings Google Cloud Document AI natively into Camunda processes, enabling workflows to submit PDFs and image files in Base64 format to a configured Document AI processor and receive structured results including text, entities, tables, and confidence scores. Authentication is handled securely through Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 using service account credentials. The connector is designed for asynchronous execution via Camunda job workers, supporting scalable, reliable document processing with built-in retry handling.",
